Package: SHAPTURE
Title: Sample-Aware SHAP-Based Feature Discovery for Single-Cell and Metacell Data
Version: 0.0.0.9015
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Max",
           family = "Alimadadi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "alimadadi.max@gmail.com")
Author: Max Alimadadi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Max Alimadadi <alimadadi.max@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a sample-aware workflow for subset-specific and
    one-vs-others feature discovery using repeated machine learning fits,
    SHAP-based interpretation, patient-aware balancing, patient-block bootstrap
    support, optional metacell construction, and integrated marker ranking.
